===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|abundaunce}}, {{m|enm|habaundance}},<ref name=WI3/> from {{der|en|fro|habundance}},<ref name=SOED>{{R:SOED5|page=10}}</ref> {{m|fro|abondance}}, from {{der|en|la|abundantia||fullness, plenty}}, from {{m|la|abundō||to overflow}}. Equivalent to {{suf|en|abound|ance}}. {{displaced|ang|geniht|t=abundance, [[plenty]]}}.

